MECHANISM: ${f.mechanism}
EVIDENCE: ${f.evidence}
CLAIMS IT WOULD HAVE CAUGHT: ${f.wouldHaveCaught}
TIER: ${f.enforcementTier}

Refute if ANY of these hold:
- The guard would NOT actually have fired on the specific session failure it claims to catch. Walk through it concretely and check.
